    "steam_appid": 3452840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/76ec367dabfc92dc673fb2e7b1c8244c.avif?t=1752685899\" width=680 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primal Fray: Prologue</strong> is a thrilling <strong>turn-based strategy roguelite</strong> where combat unfolds on procedurally generated, hex-based flying islands. Outsmart and defeat even the most powerful enemies with your cunningly assembled team of Primals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/8a31def07eb5de62de15869c03850525.poster.avif?t=1752685899\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/8a31def07eb5de62de15869c03850525.webm?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/8a31def07eb5de62de15869c03850525.mp4?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Adventure Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Primal Fray: Prologue</strong> you will enter the Rift as a member of the first expedition, sent to extract resources vital for restoring Earth ravaged by climate change. The fate of humanity rests on your shoulders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/9b69823c9d327c09ba1c9db09e203900.poster.avif?t=1752685899\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/9b69823c9d327c09ba1c9db09e203900.webm?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/9b69823c9d327c09ba1c9db09e203900.mp4?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each run, you'll compose your own team of mighty Primals. You will need to think strategically, adapt your tactics to the ever-changing conditions, and find clever ways to utilize the resources at your disposal.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/74fba0e1b4e1bb78a87eae14dcec6951.poster.avif?t=1752685899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/74fba0e1b4e1bb78a87eae14dcec6951.webm?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/74fba0e1b4e1bb78a87eae14dcec6951.mp4?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Guardian</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, you will have to face a powerful boss with unique mechanics and attacks. Are you up to the task? Make sure to build the best possible team of your Primals and defeat the powerful Guardian of the Grove!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/f92f4ee0130b8e4b7e32d6dd06e0b0e6.poster.avif?t=1752685899\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/f92f4ee0130b8e4b7e32d6dd06e0b0e6.webm?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/f92f4ee0130b8e4b7e32d6dd06e0b0e6.mp4?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every run, you embark on a unique adventure. Each map is procedurally generated, meaning no two fights are the same, and every encounter presents new challenges and opportunities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/ce1e14ccb51a4392593a0946aa09d159.poster.avif?t=1752685899\" width=640 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/ce1e14ccb51a4392593a0946aa09d159.webm?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/ce1e14ccb51a4392593a0946aa09d159.mp4?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Fray</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primal Fray: Prequel</strong> is just the beginning of the journey! Dive into an epic adventure with Primal Fray, filled with battles, bosses, and challenges. Fight your way through the Rift and be the first one to uncover all its secrets! Visit the Primal Fray Steam page and add it to your wishlist today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/ad8c89f40417082323b27f5b6cf5e90e.poster.avif?t=1752685899\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/ad8c89f40417082323b27f5b6cf5e90e.webm?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/ad8c89f40417082323b27f5b6cf5e90e.mp4?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/76ec367dabfc92dc673fb2e7b1c8244c.avif?t=1752685899\" width=680 height=74 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/76ec367dabfc92dc673fb2e7b1c8244c.avif?t=1752685899\" width=680 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primal Fray: Prologue</strong> is a thrilling <strong>turn-based strategy roguelite</strong> where combat unfolds on procedurally generated, hex-based flying islands. Outsmart and defeat even the most powerful enemies with your cunningly assembled team of Primals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/8a31def07eb5de62de15869c03850525.poster.avif?t=1752685899\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/8a31def07eb5de62de15869c03850525.webm?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/8a31def07eb5de62de15869c03850525.mp4?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Adventure Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Primal Fray: Prologue</strong> you will enter the Rift as a member of the first expedition, sent to extract resources vital for restoring Earth ravaged by climate change. The fate of humanity rests on your shoulders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/9b69823c9d327c09ba1c9db09e203900.poster.avif?t=1752685899\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/9b69823c9d327c09ba1c9db09e203900.webm?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/webm; c