/steam/apps/3452840/extras/f92f4ee0130b8e4b7e32d6dd06e0b0e6.mp4?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every run, you embark on a unique adventure. Each map is procedurally generated, meaning no two fights are the same, and every encounter presents new challenges and opportunities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/ce1e14ccb51a4392593a0946aa09d159.poster.avif?t=1752685899\" width=640 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/ce1e14ccb51a4392593a0946aa09d159.webm?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/ce1e14ccb51a4392593a0946aa09d159.mp4?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Fray</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primal Fray: Prequel</strong> is just the beginning of the journey! Dive into an epic adventure with Primal Fray, filled with battles, bosses, and challenges. Fight your way through the Rift and be the first one to uncover all its secrets! Visit the Primal Fray Steam page and add it to your wishlist today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/ad8c89f40417082323b27f5b6cf5e90e.poster.avif?t=1752685899\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/ad8c89f40417082323b27f5b6cf5e90e.webm?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/ad8c89f40417082323b27f5b6cf5e90e.mp4?t=1752685899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452840/extras/76ec367dabfc92dc673fb2e7b1c8244c.avif?t=1752685899\" width=680 height=74 /></span></p>",
